      "text": "Innovation derives from:\n\n1️⃣ lots of experimentation\n2️⃣ the ability to live with the collateral damage of your failures\n\nFailure, while a tragedy, is a Darwinian imperative.\n\nIn the ruins of failure, there is often a glimmer of treasure.",
